- What is Apriori? An algorithm for frequent itemset mining.
- What is an itemset? A group of one or more items.
- What is support? Frequency of an itemset in transactions.
- What is confidence? Probability of consequent given antecedent.
- What is lift? Strength of association compared to independent occurrence.
- What is pruning? Removing itemsets that cannot be frequent.
- What is the Apriori principle? All subsets of a frequent itemset must be frequent.
