6. Viva questions
- What is FP-Growth? Frequent Pattern Growth algorithm.
- What is an FP-Tree? A compact tree representing transaction data.
- What is conditional pattern base? The set of prefix paths associated with an item.
- Why is FP-Growth faster than Apriori? It avoids extensive candidate generation.
- Does FP-Growth generate candidate itemsets? No, it mines patterns directly from the FP-Tree.
Writeup
